SDK licensing scope
===================

APLUX proprietary implementation contributions are covered only to the extent
APLUX owns or may license them by LICENSES/Pandora-Model-SDK.zh-CN.txt and its
English translation LICENSES/Pandora-Model-SDK.en.txt. Third-party code retains
its applicable terms. The interface header and verifier are Apache-2.0.
Vendor runtimes and model packages are external and retain their own terms.
Keep these notices and accompanying full license texts with this SDK payload.
